                <pb facs="0669" n="583" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg583"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Posadas to Mr.
                            Combs</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mazatenango</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-03-26"><hi rendition="#italic">March 26,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I sent you this morning, at 6 o’clock, the following telegram acknowledging
                    receipt of your telegram of yesterday’s date, the contents of which I duly note:
                    “I am extremely grateful for the care you have taken of my interests.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alberto Posadas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
